---
---
<section id="open-source" class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Open Source Philosophy</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        We believe businesses should own their AI infrastructure, their models, and their data.
        Our entire stack is built on open-source technologies — no black boxes, no hidden fees,
        and complete freedom to customize, audit, and extend.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🐧</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Linux</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Ubuntu Server LTS — secure, stable, and community-supported.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🐳</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Docker & Containers</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Isolated, reproducible services — easy to manage, update, and scale.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🔓</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">No Vendor Lock-in</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">You own the hardware, the software, and the models. Migrate anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">👁️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Transparent & Auditable</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Full access to configurations, logs, and source code — nothing hidden.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🤝</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Community Driven</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Built on Llama, Qwen, Ollama, Open WebUI, Qdrant — powered by global open-source collaboration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center hover:border-indigo-300 relative group">
        <span class="text-3xl mb-2 block">🛡️</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy First</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Data never leaves your premises. No telemetry, no tracking, no third-party access.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>